   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Past in the past",
     "texto": [
      "For what was going on: the imperfect. For what happened: the passato prossimo. For what came before that: the pluperfect.",
      "Example: **Quando sono tornato, la piazza era vuota, perché tutti erano andati** (when I came back, the square was empty, because everyone had gone)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Distinguishing action and state",
     "texto": [
      "**Era cambiato** means «had changed»: it is the pluperfect, earlier than another past moment. To describe a state **era diverso** (was different) or **era vuoto** (was empty) is used.",
      "**Non c'era più** = was no longer there / there was no longer any."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
